# Demo output: never commit private keys, even throwaway ones.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignoring *.pem / *.der / *.crl repo-wide. This file applies
# to the whole repository, and those globs would silently swallow another
# module's certificate test fixtures -- git add would appear to do nothing, with
# no error to explain why. The demo writes to a temp directory outside the repo
# by default, so the narrow rule below is enough.
keys/
